 new problem.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8032553743,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAAB3scLDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/has%20workaround","name":"has workaround","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"There’s a bug, but users have a complete workaround, so no urgent fix or release is needed.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9169581687,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACIoy2dw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20combobox","name":"component: combobox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the combobox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-05-27T13:24:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T14:26:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Feature request\n\n## Summary\n\nI'd like to request support for a built-in way to render a \"Select all visible\" option so selecting mutlitple options can be done with 1 click on top pinned item in Combobox list.\nMy suggestion is to add new components - ListHeader and SelectAll so usage may look like this:\n```tsx\n<Combobox.List>\n  <Combobox.ListHeader>\n    <Combobox.SelectAll />\n  </Combobox.ListHeader>\n  <Combobox.Collection>\n  {(item) => (\n    <Combobox.Item value={item}>\n      {item.label}\n    </Combobox.Item>\n  )}\n  </Combobox.Collection>\n</Combobox.List>\n```\n\n## Examples in other libraries\n\n[Prime React](https://primereact.org/multiselect/)\n\n## Motivation\n\nI'm trying to create a combobox with top pinned option that changes selection for all visible options.\n\n<img width=\"314\" height=\"577\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f407c842-b8f6-42df-bc18-f06bf42f8203\" />\n\nI was able to achive that behaviour with controlled api and some additional context, but I think it would be nice to have same functionality out of the box and for uncontrolled component as well.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}